            <fr:title text="First Set">First Set</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
  The first set (<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {First}(\cdot )]]></fr:tex>) of a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> are all the characters that may appear at the beginning of a word in the language of <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>.

  <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[ \mathsf {First}(A) = \{ c ~|~ \exists  w . cw \in  L(A) \}]]></fr:tex></html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
